/if-then-else
/if (X > Y)
/    X = X + X
/else
/    Y = Y + Y
Compare,    Load X
            Subt Y  / x - y > 0, x > y, jump to doubleX
            SkipCond 800
            Jump doubleY
            Jump doubleX

/subroutine
doubleX,    Load X
            Add X
            Store X
            Output
            Jump End

doubleY,    Load Y
            Add Y
            Store Y
            Output
            Jump End

End,        Halt

X,      dec 10
Y,      dec 5